# --- strings only go between pinned cards: a wrong one opens nothing; taking it down frays it
pin c_owner_bus p_sujin
link c_owner_bus p_sujin
nogo Bus stop
unlink c_owner_bus p_sujin
# --- what he said, pinned to the right things: the bus stop opens (silently)
