pin ph_2
link c_owner_bus ph_2
nogo Bus stop
unlink c_owner_bus ph_2
pin ph_1
link c_owner_bus ph_1
spot Bus stop
idle
photo 14 32 18 24
back
expect @lab&go_busstop
